Description: SecuBox nDPId — DPI dashboard with JA3/JA4 TLS fingerprinting
 nDPId-backed deep packet inspection dashboard: JA3/JA3S/JA4 TLS
 fingerprinting, protocol detection, application classification,
 risk scoring, and SQLite flow database.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the DPI cluster:
  - secubox-dpi — DPI-backed analytics layer (top apps,
    bandwidth, mirred setup) — see #382 for the layered model.
  - secubox-mediaflow — streaming/VoIP classifier consuming DPI.
